s": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 12}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n1le02ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100 ", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Daniel </span>: In this presentation, we are going to talk about computer software and types of software.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Martha </span>:  In simple words, what does computer software mean?  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Daniel </span>: In order to understand what computer software is, let me ask you a question: Do we speak the same language as computers?  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Martha </span>:  Hmm. I guess we don't. Why do you ask me that?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: Because computers work with binary code, and they only understand low-level language. With this in mind, we need to remember that if we want a computer to do something, we need to translate the command we give so a computer can understand it. In other words, the computer needs to understand what we say."}, {"time": "40000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>:  So, the translator is the software, isn't it? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: That's right. Software makes the computer suitable for us. There are many categories of software depending on the uses, functions, and types. We can group the types of software into three broad categories: domain of use, domain of execution, and programming tools.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>:  What does domain of use mean? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>:  It's a category based on the purpose of the software. This type of software enables users to complete a task. You can personalize your computer by adding or removing applications or programs that are created for a purpose. For example, if you need to do a report, you install a program such as a word processor that allows you to write it."}, {"time": "87000", "image": "enpe8n1le02ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Martha </span>: I see. So, what does domain of execution software do? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Daniel </span>: Well, in this category, we can find desktop applications such as office suites, web applications, plugins, web browsers, firmware, etc. This type of software allows other programs to run.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Martha</span>: OK. One last question: What does programming tools refer to? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>:  Programming tools are also applications or programs, but they are different because software developers use them to produce, repair, maintain, or support other programs and applications. They can be debuggers, compilers, linkers, etc."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n1le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}